OL,3,ABurnham to fight next election on
OL,4,Apledge to change voting system
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has promised that Labour
OL,7,Fwill fight the next general election on
OL,8,Fa pledge to change the UK's voting
OL,9,Fsystem.
OL,11,FIn his first party conference speech as
OL,12,Fprime minister, he announced plans for
OL,13,Fa national commission to explore
OL,14,Foptions for electoral reform.
OL,16,FHe invited other parties to work with
OL,17,Fthe commission to ensure "everyone's
OL,18,Fvote counts, and everyone's voice is
OL,19,Fheard".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
