OL,3,A'I was lured into a trap': Evan
OL,4,AGershkovich on moment that led to 16
OL,5,Amonths in Russian jail
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS journalist Evan Gershkovich has said
OL,8,Fthat he knew he was being set up by
OL,9,FRussia when he was arrested by FSB
OL,10,Fagents and accused of being a spy.
OL,12,FIn an interview with Radio 4's Today
OL,13,Fprogramme, Gershkovich spoke about the
OL,14,Fmoment he realised he had been "lured
OL,15,Finto a trap" when masked men surrounded
OL,16,Fhim at a restaurant in 2023, and
OL,17,Fdetained him.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11910
SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790709943
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I was lured into a trap': Evan
OL,4,AGershkovich on moment that led to 16
OL,5,Amonths in Russian jail
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'm not interrogated, I'm not
OL,8,Ftortured... I'm accused of espionage,"
OL,9,Fhe said, describing a sense of relief:
OL,10,F"They've set me up and fabricated this
OL,11,Fcase so that I can be a valuable
OL,12,Fhostage - a pawn in a greater game".
OL,14,FGershkovich, now 34, was sentenced to
OL,15,F16 years in prison, but freed 16 months
OL,16,Flater as part of a high-profile
OL,17,Fprisoner swap deal.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
